  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Base -- the Coinbase-incubated OP Stack L2, part of the Ethereum Superchain, with EVM equivalence, sub-cent fees, and Coinbase ecosystem integration. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and NFTs. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
